WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Wanwan is our daughter, how could she not take action?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,280
You three will die together, Wanwan

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,240
don't listen to her

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,600
Don’t you have water arts skills?

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,560
Fight with her once

6
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,560
If you really want to do it

7
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,960
Can I still sleep in this life? Wanwan

8
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,360
Dad, Mom, don’t blame me

9
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,320
Materials are not enough

10
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,760
Your artistic skills can't help

11
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,880
I'm still young

12
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,320
I can't die with you

13
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,860
Wanwan, you have done what you said now

14
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,420
Can we start over?

15
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,700
I only let you make a choice

16
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,060
when did i say

17
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,060
will let you go
